  "details": "<p>According to an Akkadian inscription of Ninurta-kudurr\u012b-u\u1e63ur of Suhu, the Minu\u02be\u00fb, together with other Aramean tribal groups, attacked the land L\u0101q\u00ea. The Minu\u02be\u00fb and their allies were defeated by Ninurta-kudurr\u012b-u\u1e63ur.</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The name of a nomadic Aramean tribal group that was in the middle Euphrates region during the early part of the first millennium B.C.",
